# The PS2's tfrag geomorph (c3l::ExtTfrag): the title flight, Fire Canyon, village2, Lava Tube and
# Citadel. Each view: a "view" window (the [softstats] lines in it) and pairs of shots on
# consecutive frames (with CTR_TFRAG_AB=1 the odd one has every group's near version).
# Host: CTR_SOFT_STATS=60 gk --ctr-gfx --ctr-dump DIR ...
0 wait *target* target-title-wait
1200 log view-begin title
1300 shot tfraglod_title_1300
1301 shot tfraglod_title_1301
1800 shot tfraglod_title_1800
1801 shot tfraglod_title_1801
2300 shot tfraglod_title_2300
2301 shot tfraglod_title_2301
2310 log view-end title
2320 continue firecanyon-start
2321 wait *target* target-continue
2322 wait *target* target-stance
2620 log view-begin firecanyon
2980 shot tfraglod_firecanyon_a
2981 shot tfraglod_firecanyon_b
2982 log view-end firecanyon
2990 continue village2-start
2991 wait *target* target-continue
2992 wait *target* target-stance
3290 log view-begin village2
3650 shot tfraglod_village2_a
3651 shot tfraglod_village2_b
3652 log view-end village2
3660 continue lavatube-start
3661 wait *target* target-continue
3662 wait *target* target-stance
3960 log view-begin lavatube
4320 shot tfraglod_lavatube_a
4321 shot tfraglod_lavatube_b
4322 log view-end lavatube
4330 continue citadel-start
4331 wait *target* target-continue
4332 wait *target* target-stance
4630 log view-begin citadel
4990 shot tfraglod_citadel_a
4991 shot tfraglod_citadel_b
4992 log view-end citadel
5000 exit
